message: "If you use these codes or data, please cite the article given as the preferred citation."
title: "Spectral Green functions for T-duality-regularized electrostatics in finite and bounded planar geometries: codes and data"
abstract: >-
  Julia codes and data for the spectral Green functions of T-duality-regularized
  electrostatics in two space dimensions. The scripts compute, by lattice sums with a
  controlled truncation, the neutral-pair energy and the running interaction dimension on
  the square torus, which the article compares with the infinite plane; the repository also
  holds their reference output, the convergence reports and the LaTeX sources of the article.
